{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, great to chat again! A lot has happened since we last spoke. Last week, I decided to run for office again - even though I haven't been successful before. I guess I can't let go of my dream to make a difference in my community. Can you believe it? Feels like a dream come true!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-ee31834468d89df302f960bc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.066000+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ee31834468d89df302f960bc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ee31834468d89df302f960bc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Way to go, John! You're doing great. I'm so proud of you for sticking with it. You're always dreaming up ways to make a difference and I'm sure your drive will pay off. Don't be afraid to take risks-- I'm 100% behind you!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-da63315371da41203bcaa67c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.086291+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da63315371da41203bcaa67c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da63315371da41203bcaa67c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Maria, your support really means a lot! It's tough, but your kind words give me the motivation to keep going. I've still got a lot to learn, but I'm determined to make a difference. I appreciate your belief in me."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-2c9df364eefa3d6e2e0d8053", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.102290+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c9df364eefa3d6e2e0d8053", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c9df364eefa3d6e2e0d8053", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: John, I believe in you! Even small steps will make a difference. Keep going and stay true to yourself. You got this!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-e65f007ff16d70c211051889", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.116116+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e65f007ff16d70c211051889", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e65f007ff16d70c211051889", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! Your words really mean something. Sometimes it feels like it's too much, but your encouragement gives me the strength to keep going."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-e4f66fda94c28b342b8e52dc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.127738+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e4f66fda94c28b342b8e52dc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e4f66fda94c28b342b8e52dc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, it's okay to feel overwhelmed from time to time. Just remember to pause, reflect, and take care of yourself. I'm here for you - let me know how I can support you."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-7931833055888b1bf3cd5c7e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.141620+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7931833055888b1bf3cd5c7e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7931833055888b1bf3cd5c7e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Got it. It's easy to get lost and forget that. Appreciate your support. How's that going for you?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-42ed4b22cc022087c864d8a9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.152805+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "42ed4b22cc022087c864d8a9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "42ed4b22cc022087c864d8a9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I've been doing great lately. I've been involved in some charity work and it's been really rewarding. I feel connected and it's really fulfilling."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-29293b011afba9123a1ff27f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.164209+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "29293b011afba9123a1ff27f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "29293b011afba9123a1ff27f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! Glad you found something that brings you so much joy. What kind of work have you been doing?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-5956fdb81c1e83b996df3d15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.177385+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5956fdb81c1e83b996df3d15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5956fdb81c1e83b996df3d15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Just yesterday I joined a nearby church. I wanted to feel closer to a community and my faith. So far it's been really great!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-d21bfbf5dfa4cdfcb59bb4e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.186523+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d21bfbf5dfa4cdfcb59bb4e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d21bfbf5dfa4cdfcb59bb4e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's great, Maria! Joining a church can be really encouraging. I'm thrilled for you. How's everything been going?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-60b4785a9e1f15051b98778c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.196568+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "60b4785a9e1f15051b98778c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "60b4785a9e1f15051b98778c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Life's been a bit rough lately but I'm doing alright. I'm taking the time to reflect and find some balance. How about you? What's been going on since we last talked?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-5f6c2e6b1f8ea7c36f94edc8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.208446+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5f6c2e6b1f8ea7c36f94edc8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5f6c2e6b1f8ea7c36f94edc8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I had a similar experience. Last week, there was a power cut in our area, and it made me realize the importance of upgrading our infrastructure for stable services for everyone. Look how dark it was!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-56222f6f9461e33f24f7d7b9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.220715+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "56222f6f9461e33f24f7d7b9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "56222f6f9461e33f24f7d7b9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, that's rough. Anything else around here that needs to be fixed so it doesn't happen again?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-adc312ff7ce9fd47c64cb540", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.233885+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "adc312ff7ce9fd47c64cb540", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "adc312ff7ce9fd47c64cb540", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yep, Maria. Mainly the roadways. They're full of potholes and can be dangerous for drivers and damaging to cars. Some improvements are definitely needed."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-c4fcd77c8933b66b0bcc7a32", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.245100+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c4fcd77c8933b66b0bcc7a32", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c4fcd77c8933b66b0bcc7a32", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, I remember you mentioning the roads. They can be quite dangerous, huh? Is there anything I can do to help improve the situation?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-ebb4fb46ddfcbca7a1ff8cc2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.256512+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ebb4fb46ddfcbca7a1ff8cc2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ebb4fb46ddfcbca7a1ff8cc2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for the offer, Maria. I'm thinking about starting a community project regarding infrastructure, so maybe we can work together to get the neighborhood's backing."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-9ad4292998d1c557ed02c980", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.266511+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9ad4292998d1c557ed02c980", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9ad4292998d1c557ed02c980", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds like a plan, John! Let's work together to get the community involved and make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-4f5a5aa98a9ff4b29f20ddf6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.277521+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f5a5aa98a9ff4b29f20ddf6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f5a5aa98a9ff4b29f20ddf6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That pic makes me think of how important it is to fight for better housing and living conditions in our neighborhood. We can definitely make a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-eaa36424aa219c1424e59d7d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.289534+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eaa36424aa219c1424e59d7d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eaa36424aa219c1424e59d7d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Definitely, John! It's important that everyone has access to affordable housing. Let's get the community on board and fight for better living standards. We can make a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-6e4559a6fa33e08c3912b98d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.301337+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e4559a6fa33e08c3912b98d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e4559a6fa33e08c3912b98d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Sure, Maria! Let's work together to make a real difference. Our neighborhood deserves it! I want to work on improving my old area, West County, too."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-b45be78e0878ac275d2a806b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.312515+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b45be78e0878ac275d2a806b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b45be78e0878ac275d2a806b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yep, John! We should all join forces to create a safe and bustling environment for our community, and others too. Let's make some real change."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-9cb9021e9fb5b1be001f6838", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.325160+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9cb9021e9fb5b1be001f6838", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9cb9021e9fb5b1be001f6838", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria, let's keep working together to make our neighborhood something to be proud of! We'll keep going and never give up."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-41/session_14-956c4571457bef282522d6e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:27:23.335720+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "956c4571457bef282522d6e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "956c4571457bef282522d6e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
